  "description": "Kyuhyun accidentally comes out when he unintentionally sends a photo of himself kissing his (ex-)boyfriend to a group chat. Panicked, he thinks, \"I'm screwed. Someone already saw it.\" Unable to sleep properly and filled with fear, he walks into the lecture hall, only to meet Kibum’s intense gaze. \"Hey, what time does your class end today?\" That simple question marks the beginning of more frequent encounters between them. As they spend more time together, Kyuhyun’s fear gradually turns into excitement, and the atmosphere between them starts shifting in an unexpected direction. \"Go out with me. I'll become the person you love.\" \n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
